{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07523","headline":"题杼山癸亭得暮字 · 颜真卿","name":"题杼山癸亭得暮字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杼山多幽绝，胜事盈跬步。\n前者虽登攀，淹留恨晨暮。\n及兹纡胜引，曾是美无度。\n歘构三癸亭，实爲陆生故。\n高贤能剏物，疏凿皆有趣。\n不越方丈间，居然云霄遇。\n巍峨倚修岫，旷望临古渡。\n左右苔石攒，低昂桂枝蠹。\n山僧狎猨狖，巢鸟来枳椇。\n俯视何楷台，傍瞻戴顒路。\n迟回未能下，夕照明村树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}